@startuml
title 消费 MQ 刷新 channel_limited_poi_list 缓存
autonumber
participant "DbusPoiChannelChangeConsumer\n(新增consumer)" as C
participant "WmActCouponConfigWrapperCache" as W
participant "Rhino 限流" as R
participant "分布式锁\nTairSetnxLockService" as L
participant "Cellar 缓存" as KV
participant "DB\ntsp_act_poi_channel" as DB

C -> C: 校验入口总开关、判断操作类型\n(仅 INSERT/DELETE/UPDATE 放行，其余结束)

C -> R++: 消费限流校验
return

C -> W++: 查渠道下有效券的发放条件缓存（getByChannelId）
return

opt 若渠道下没有有效券配置了多门店新老客发放条件(含targetUserType字段)
    note over C: 跳过刷新，结束
end


alt INSERT/DELETE
    C -> KV++:  读缓存-getByChannelId
    return Result
    alt INSERT & 缓存 poiCount > 2k
      note over C:缓存中 poi 数量已达上限，跳过刷新，结束
    else DELETE & 缓存中无此 poi
      note over C:缓存中无此 poi，跳过刷新，结束
    end
else UPDATE
'    C -> KV++:  读缓存ttl-ChannelId
'    return Result
    C -> L++: 获取 update+channel 分布式锁，过期时间30min（Lion可配）\n不会主动释放，目的是update限流
    return
    opt 未获取到锁
      note over C: update操作且30min内已刷新过，结束
    end
end

  C -> R++: 查 DB 限流 (Rhino)
  return 放行

  C -> DB++: DB 查前 2k(Lion可配) poiIdList
  return

  C -> KV++: 覆盖写，expireTime=30d（(Lion可配)）
  return
@enduml